{"ID":"20230925154752-jeoi0ud","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154752-jeoi0ud","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154752-jeoi0ud\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154759-s6cogn3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154759-rrg3oem\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154759-rrg3oem\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:76,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:76\u0026#125;","title":"【乌头汤】（乌头麻黄黄芪芍药甘草汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154759"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154759-s6cogn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154759-s6cogn3","updated":"20230925154759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：乌头五枚（切）、麻黄三两、黄芪三两、芍药三两、甘草三两"}]},{"ID":"20230925154759-lyn3ijg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154759-lyn3ijg","updated":"20230925154759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右五味，先以蜜二升煮乌头，取一升，去滓，别以水三升煮四味，取一升，去滓，纳蜜再煎一二沸，服七合，不知尽服之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154759-vooxcef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154759-vooxcef","updated":"20230925154759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【14.72】病历节，疼痛不可屈伸，脉沉弱者，乌头麻黄黄芪芍药甘草汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154759-rrg3oem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154759-rrg3oem","updated":"20230925154759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了乌头汤可能会有的反应：出粘汗，手脚软，人像喝醉了一样，头闷胀的不得了；如果是脉搏开始少跳，就说明中毒了，如需解毒，用真蜂蜜兑水就这样灌，可解乌头毒；"}]}]}